{"3604980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Duster Buster", "steam_appid": 3604980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/807637ff21a6220b70fc359ff5f7ebc9.poster.avif?t=1774367304\" width=580 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/807637ff21a6220b70fc359ff5f7ebc9.webm?t=1774367304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Rat, what's the game about? Please tell us</strong></i><br><i> </i><br> <br><i>Duster Buster is a <strong>Pixel-art rogue-lite</strong> adventure blending <strong>horror and humor</strong>. Players take on the role as a cleaner hired to clean a big, run-down mansion filled with furniture-monsters. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game’s quirky take on both combat, character-building, and cleaning, along with a lighthearted story, makes it approachable for casual players interested in a fun experience with a sometimes hardcore genre, while still somewhat challenging for advanced fans of the genre.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player unravels the secrets of the <strong>mansion</strong>, guided by their <strong>rat-merchant sidekick</strong>, they get to choose a build that works for them, adding a layer of replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/09b1fba6f77c63a90be331aa5c700d1a.apng?t=1774367304\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/09b1fba6f77c63a90be331aa5c700d1a.poster.avif?t=1774367304\" class=\"bb_img\" width=488 height=214 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Hey Cleaner what can we do?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RunLight attack <br>Heavy attack <br>Dodge / Dash <br>Clean corpses <br>Upgrade <br>Speaking (Dialogue System)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Hey Cleaner what can't we do?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though we - just like our cleaner - pride ourselves for being thorough, there might be some tricky bugs hiding. Regardless, we  wanted to share this little gem as a reminder of one of our first “bigger” prototypes with you rather than hiding it away in a dusty drawer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that you enjoy this small spark of our imagination, creativity and skills, while we continue our journey as devs.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/807637ff21a6220b70fc359ff5f7ebc9.poster.avif?t=1774367304\" width=580 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/807637ff21a6220b70fc359ff5f7ebc9.webm?t=1774367304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Rat, what's the game about? Please tell us</strong></i><br><i> </i><br> <br><i>Duster Buster is a <strong>Pixel-art rogue-lite</strong> adventure blending <strong>horror and humor</strong>. Players take on the role as a cleaner hired to clean a big, run-down mansion filled with furniture-monsters. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game’s quirky take on both combat, character-building, and cleaning, along with a lighthearted story, makes it approachable for casual players interested in a fun experience with a sometimes hardcore genre, while still somewhat challenging for advanced fans of the genre.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player unravels the secrets of the <strong>mansion</strong>, guided by their <strong>rat-merchant sidekick</strong>, they get to choose a build that works for them, adding a layer of replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/09b1fba6f77c63a90be331aa5c700d1a.apng?t=1774367304\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604980/extras/09b1fba6f77c63a90be331aa5c700d1a.poster.avif?t=1774367304\" class=\"bb_img\" width=488 height=214 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Hey Cleaner what can we do?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RunLight attack <br>Heavy attack <br>Dodge / Dash <br>Clean corpses <br>Upgrade <br>Speaking (Dialogue System)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Hey Cleaner what can't we do?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though we - just like our cleaner - pride ourselves for being thorough, there might be some tricky bugs hiding. Regardless, we  wanted to share this little gem as a reminder of one of our first “bigger” prototypes with you rather than hiding it away in a dusty drawer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that you enjoy this small spark of our imagination, creativity and skills, while we continue our journey as devs.</p>", "short_description": "Duster Buster is a short 2D rogue-lite where you clean your way through a stylized pixel art haunted mansion. Fight dusty furniture, survive quick runs on a linear map, unlock upgrades, and uncover the mansion’s secrets in fast, repeatable play sessions.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.